OL,3,AKyiv bridge hit in further Russian
OL,4,Adrone attack as German chancellor makes
OL,5,Asurprise visit
OL,6,
OL,7,FMajor bridges in Kyiv have been
OL,8,Ftargeted by Russian strikes for four
OL,9,Fconsecutive days, as Moscow ramps up
OL,10,Fattacks on critical infrastructure in
OL,11,Fthe capital.
OL,13,FThe Pivnichnyi (Northern) Bridge was
OL,14,Fhit on Sunday morning for the second
OL,15,Fday in a row, while the Pivdennyi
OL,16,F(Southern) Bridge was hit in multiple
OL,17,Fattacks earlier in the week.
OL,19,FThe latest bridge attack came as German
OL,20,FChancellor Friedrich Merz made a
OL,21,Fsurprise visit to the capital on
OL,22,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
